    "title": "🎁 Freebies Up for Grabs in Baltimore - Furniture, Baby Gear & More - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago Looking for something useful without spending a dime? Baltimore neighbors are giving away all kinds of free items this week — from furniture and baby gear to home goods and more. Check out what’s available below!\nFree Dining Room Table Condition: Excellent\nLocation: 1435 Hull Street\nA sturdy dining table that seats six, with all pieces and hardware included. Perfect for family dinners or gatherings.\n👉 See this item on Craigslist\nCURB ALERT – Infant Tub Location: 2404 Fleet Street, Baltimore\nInfant tub available for free on the curb — grab it while it’s still there!\n👉 See this item on Craigslist\nFREE/GRATIS Beds! Queen and Bunk Bed! Condition: Used - Good\nLocation: Near IKEA, 8095 Sandpiper Circle, Nottingham, MD\nTwo beds available — a white queen canopy bed with drawers and a twin bunk bed with slide and ladder. Must pick up today!\n👉 See this item on Facebook Marketplace\nFree Piano Condition: Used - Fair\nLocation: Baltimore, MD\nA free piano looking for a new home. Great for beginners or anyone wanting to practice.\n👉 See this item on Facebook Marketplace\nFree Crate and Barrel Entertainment Center Condition: Used - Good\nLocation: Baltimore, MD\nA stylish brown Crate & Barrel entertainment console with removable hutch. From a non-smoking home.\n👉 See this item on Facebook Marketplace\nFree Solid Wood Desk Condition: Used - Good\nLocation: Baltimore, MD\nSolid wood desk, about 26” deep x 45” wide x 30” high. Great for a home office or study space.\n👉 See this item on Facebook Marketplace\nSmall Recliner/Rocker Condition: Like new\nLocation: 4706 Furley Ave, 21206\nFree recliner/rocker with cover, available on the sidewalk. Will be removed once gone.\n👉 See this item on Facebook Marketplace\nBasinet (FREE) Condition: Used - Good\nLocation: 21239, Baltimore\nA baby basinet in good condition, ready for pickup.\n👉 See this item on Facebook Marketplace\nFree Microwave (NE Baltimore City) Condition: Good\nLocation: 4600 block of Elsrode Avenue, Lauraville\nWorking microwave available on the sidewalk — first come, first served.\n👉 See this item on Craigslist\nFirewood FREE! Location: E. Strathmore Ave, 21214 (Lauraville)\nLarge pile of seasoned firewood, great for fireplaces or outdoor pits.\n👉 See this item on Nextdoor\nFREE Proform Treadmill Barely Used Condition: Like new\nLocation: Baltimore, MD\nA gently used treadmill that folds upright for easy storage. Works great and ready for pickup.\n👉 See this item on Facebook Marketplace",
